			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance submodules — Streamline IPC abstractions and revert test configs\n\nUpdate Common and Mountain submodules to clean up IPC module documentation and remove test artifacts:\n\n**Common** (refactor): Condense IPC module documentation to concise summaries, removing verbose BEM-style section comments. Drop `EstablishHostConnection` and `ProxyCallToSideCar` effect constructors as the IPC abstraction is being streamlined. Retain `SendNotificationToSideCar` and `SendRequestToSideCar` for active sidecar communication patterns.\n\nThe core IPC contract (`IPCProvider`), channel registry, and Sky event table remain intact.\n\n**Mountain** (chore): Revert Cargo.toml and tauri.conf.json to standard binary names after completing Electron profile testing. Remove verbose build configuration descriptors from all identifiers. Reorganize Sky resource mappings in tauri.conf.json and delete duplicate paths.\n\nRemove backup files (Cargo.toml.Backup, tauri.conf.json.Backup) created during testing. Reset application identifier to `fiddee.editor.binary` and strip Electron-specific suffixes.",
