			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance submodules — Remove deprecated modules and rebuild artifacts\n\nUpdate five element submodules to clean up dead code and synchronize compiled output:\n\n**Air** (refactor): Remove deprecated Mountain module from library exports, eliminating unused public API surface.\n\n**Cocoon** (chore): Rebuild all Target/ artifacts after RouteManifest regeneration. Mountain method count remains at 142 — no new RPC methods added.\n\n**Grove** (refactor): Consolidate public module declarations in Library.rs. Remove exports for API, Common, and Services modules, retaining only Binary, DevLog, Host, Protocol, Transport, and WASM.\n\n**Mountain** (chore): Configure debug build artifacts for Electron profile testing by renaming binary and package identifiers with full build configuration descriptor. Update tauri.conf.json resources to explicitly map all Sky build targets. Remove unused WorkspaceFileService module declaration.\n\n**Rest** (chore): Rebuild bin/Rest binary to incorporate upstream documentation and style fixes from submodule 92b20ce6.\n\nThis cleanup pass streamlines the module trees across five elements and ensures compiled artifacts are synchronized with recent manifest regenerations.",
