			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Common submodule — Restore Effect module for ActionEffect system\n\nUpdate Common submodule to commit aa6701d8, which re-adds the Effect module to the public API in Library.rs. This module defines the core ActionEffect trait and associated types that power Common's abstract effect system used across Mountain, Cocoon, and other elements.\n\nThe module was previously removed during a deprecation pass but is needed as the foundational abstraction for the editor's effect-based architecture.",
